  "about": "Match cases shared by the Go root package, the tenancy sub-package and the Python package, so the three read issuers the same way. In \"census\", entry is the census string the issuer matched (an exact issuer or an issuer pattern), or null for no match; tenant is the tenant the issuer names, empty for an exact issuer. \"synthetic\" holds small invented censuses for the rules the real one cannot exercise: which of two matching patterns wins, and how a tenant is spelled. \"get\" holds lookups by host, which the Go root package and the Python package answer with the census entry's name, or null. scripts/build.py copies this file to python/tests/match_cases.json so the Python source distribution carries its own copy.",
